+# Agent prompt: finish the UX pass (remaining items only)
+
+Repo: `Root_Planner` (socroot-topology-studio). Baseline verified at commit `52f9a3b`: clean build, 175 tests passing, main chunk about 444 kB.
+
+## Goal
+Finish the UX pass. Do not touch the rules engine, schemas, cable rules, scoring thresholds or G-05. Start immediately; ask no questions.
+
+## Step 0
+`npm ci && npm run build && npm test`. Expected: clean build, 175 tests passing.
+
+## Work items (run `tsc` and tests after each)
+1. **Lazy loading.** In `src/components/layout/StudioLayout.tsx` (lines 26-27 import `GuidedTour` and `HelpSheet` statically), load `GuidedTour`, `HelpSheet` and the heavy modals (`SocrootAdminCliModal`, `BreakGlassModal`, `ExportBundleModal`, `ConfigEditorModal`, `EmployeeFactoryModal`, `CommandPaletteModal`) with `React.lazy` and `Suspense`, mounted only when open. Main chunk at or below 400 kB.
+2. **Focus and non-color cues.** Add a visible `focus-visible` ring to all buttons, inputs and menu items (one shared utility class). Give every cable kind in `src/registry/cables.ts` a distinct dash pattern or marker (only `ESCALATION_PATH` is dashed now), and show it in the help-sheet legend. Check text contrast (for example `text-slate-400` on `slate-900`) and raise failing pairs to WCAG AA.
+3. **Canvas.** Show edge labels on hover, on selection, or above a zoom threshold (`ProtocolEdge.tsx`). Add a floating selection toolbar: align for 2 or more selected nodes, distribute for 3 or more; remove those buttons from the top bar if the toolbar replaces them. Check the code first in case these exist under other names.
+4. **Editors.** Show an "unsaved edit" indicator in the inspector editors until the change is applied. Add "reset to default" wherever a default exists beyond `ContractTab`.
+5. **Tests** (jsdom, `tests/uxErgonomics.test.tsx`):
+   - select a node, call `deleteSelection`, click the real Undo in the toast, assert the node is back (the current test uses a mock action);
+   - `TopControlBar` moves clusters into "More" at a narrow container width (mock `useContainerWidth`);
+   - snap preference survives a reload from persistence;
+   - project delete in `StartScreen` does nothing until the dialog is confirmed;
+   - edge labels hidden below the zoom threshold and shown on hover;
+   - selection toolbar appears only at the node counts above.
+6. **Docs.** Update `docs/QA_CHECKLIST.md` with the new flows for a real-browser pass at 1024, 1280 and 1440 px. Update `docs/SYNC_NOTES.md`.
+
+## Constraints
+- No new dependencies; Tailwind and existing helpers only.
+- New strings in both `src/i18n/en.ts` and `ar.ts`; RTL must keep working (use `start/end` utilities).
+- `strict: true`, no unjustified `any`, no `TODO`, no CDN, no telemetry.
+
+## Done when
+- [ ] Build clean, all tests pass (175 plus new), main chunk at or below 400 kB, tour, help sheet and heavy modals are separate chunks.
+- [ ] The six tests in item 5 exist and pass.
+- [ ] Every cable kind is distinguishable without color; focus ring visible on all controls; contrast failures fixed or listed.
+- [ ] Final reply lists what passed, what was verified in jsdom only, and what still needs a real browser.
